    {
      "id": "a22e6f9b-ffd0-4350-ac84-4055d3ab4e17",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Untitled workflow\n\n### How it works\n\n1. A meeting recording is received via webhook and transcribed into text using OpenAI's Whisper API.\\n2. AI agents analyze the meeting content, extract key insights, and format actionable items.\\n3. The workflow matches attendees and updates contact records, tasks, and deals in HubSpot.\\n4. Personalized follow-up emails are drafted for attendees via Gmail, while meeting documents are saved to Google Docs and notifications sent to Slack.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Configure webhook trigger endpoint for meeting recording uploads.\n- - [ ] Set up credentials for OpenAI / Whisper API, Anthropic Claude, HubSpot, Gmail, Google Docs, and Slack.\n- - [ ] Define environment variables or workflow configuration settings for API URLs, contact emails, and Slack channels.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db4e884d-ecef-4a2a-8d2a-9f5d2b461216",
